Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.76,0:01:12.93,OP,,0,0,0,,好胜其实是认真的证明
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.93,0:01:15.60,OP,,0,0,0,,但就算这么说 你也不会相信吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:18.14,OP,,0,0,0,,所谓的常识 有时只是枷锁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.85,OP,,0,0,0,,正因为未知 才更值得去挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.85,0:01:23.44,OP,,0,0,0,,是真正的武士 还是路边的小角色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:25.94,OP,,0,0,0,,为了找到答案 我选择迎战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.94,0:01:31.24,OP,,0,0,0,,心中燃烧的热情如闪电般耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.99,0:01:36.83,OP,,0,0,0,,无论你变成什么模样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.83,0:01:41.12,OP,,0,0,0,,并肩作战的意志绝不动摇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:45.96,OP,,0,0,0,,勇敢迎向未知的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:51.22,OP,,0,0,0,,只为遇见令人热血沸腾的新力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:01:58.10,OP,,0,0,0,,来吧 用刀锋指向明天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.10,0:02:03.27,OP,,0,0,0,,唤醒内心温柔的强悍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.27,0:02:08.19,OP,,0,0,0,,此刻沸腾燃烧的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:12.57,OP,,0,0,0,,将绝望的气息一刀斩断
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:14.49,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}用这把“真剑”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:53.08,ED,,0,0,0,,被酸甜的雷电击中 内心翻腾
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.37,0:22:01.01,ED,,0,0,0,,未知的预感 第一次在心底悸动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.80,0:22:05.60,ED,,0,0,0,,努力过后的冰淇淋奖励
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:09.64,ED,,0,0,0,,在特别的日子里分切的蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.77,0:22:13.52,ED,,0,0,0,,彼此摆出美味的神情对视
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.64,0:22:16.61,ED,,0,0,0,,不小心笑了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.02,0:22:20.44,ED,,0,0,0,,这些闪闪发光的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.57,0:22:24.57,ED,,0,0,0,,希望能平凡地延续下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:28.70,ED,,0,0,0,,像是在许愿 像是在祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.83,0:22:32.41,ED,,0,0,0,,细细地品味每一个瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.54,0:22:36.33,ED,,0,0,0,,在朴素的塔皮上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.54,0:22:40.51,ED,,0,0,0,,你自由地点缀色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.67,0:22:44.34,ED,,0,0,0,,真拿你没办法 离不开你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.47,0:22:49.18,ED,,0,0,0,,这股让人无法抗拒的悸动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,知道厉害了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你活该 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你可终于来了 铁刃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼…鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我等到都不耐烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你们早就被包围
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,已经无处可逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.64,0:00:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要杀你们简直轻而易举
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但毁了你这股力量太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.02,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要做我的同伴啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.53,0:00:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,铁刃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起君临这个世界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,君临？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,（现场直播）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正从上空的直升机为您进行现场直播
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,请各位观众看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这座鬼丸城前聚集了大量民众
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们正为潜入城内的正义八人组加油打气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,铁刃究竟能否成功击退鬼丸 扳回一城呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,别被骗了 刃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.83,0:03:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？只要你我联手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就没有做不到的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以吃一堆美食吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这世上的所有东西都会是你的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.93,0:03:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来不错耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.56,0:03:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,刃？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我是正义的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看来笨蛋到死都不会明白
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}全员准备迎战
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}杀出一条通往鬼丸的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,呱…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,刃你听好 不要离我们太远
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再吃你上次那一套了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴上说得倒厉害…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,骗你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 白痴 蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.99,0:05:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这群人的目的是雷神珠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,以沙也加殿下为中心组成圆阵
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.55,0:05:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,旋风剑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,无聊的招式
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那这招怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,无珠雷神剑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,雷电斩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,雷…雷电斩竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}竟然不管用吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}沙也加殿下 给他珠子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.99,0:06:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,小…小次郎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.24,0:06:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.79,0:06:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是跟在下联手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有在下加入 如添百人之力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在下就拿这颗雷神珠当作见面礼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,小…小次郎你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.35,0:06:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不要被骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙竟然还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸大人您也看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.70,0:07:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙一定只是假装背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是个想要伺机偷袭我们的混账
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.37,0:07:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那是误会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在下是认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.33,0:07:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 不能被他给骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.17,0:07:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,要相信在下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是所谓的聪明反被聪明误
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.67,0:07:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.86,0:07:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你实在是太愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是为了力量才会去夺取那把雷神剑吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,既然如此 为什么不使用它？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我会运用这股得来的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天站上这个世界的顶点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,而你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,即使获得了力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,最终什么都办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,只会在这里结束一切
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,谁要在这里结束啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我要成为日本第一的武士
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定要战胜你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,（鬼丸城现场直播）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,（鬼丸与少年交战中）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕 再这样下去…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,小次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让那家伙夺得天下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,全部上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加殿下 趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是现在的刃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我相信一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.11,0:09:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,呱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你想战胜我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,连珠子都没有的你还能做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.99,0:09:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不要输了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.19,0:10:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.36,0:10:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就让我们一分高下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真是令人不敢置信的光景
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.93,0:11:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,邪恶的鬼丸 正义的刃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这场正义的对决
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.52,0:11:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,现在正迎来了最高潮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.35,0:11:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,究竟胜利女神最后会对谁微笑呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.67,0:11:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你没瞄准好目标啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事只要乱枪打鸟就会打中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓的乱枪打鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是要这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是风神剑和雷神剑的力量吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.02,0:12:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,竟敢把珠子…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不原谅你们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,小次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,做好觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.99,0:12:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,伸长吧 长竹竿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,要掉下去了 快点撑住我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你们做什么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是第几次了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.11,0:13:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这么一来就只剩下鬼丸了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.44,0:13:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.07,0:13:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就看刃的表现了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看招！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,给我飞出去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那是修行的成果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,毫不胆怯地往前踏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,乖乖当我的同伴不就好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.31,0:16:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,被风神吞噬 变成鬼的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,少在那边胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是被吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是让风神成为我的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我就用下一击让你断气吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,既然这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,只能赌这一把了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.95,0:16:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,风神破
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,有珠雷神剑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,雷电斩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,珠…珠子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.55,0:18:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真是受够了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.81,0:18:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,运气真好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.69,0:18:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,快还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,再见咯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经成长到可以折断风神剑的程度了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 放马过来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怎…怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:20:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾 我们留待下次决胜负吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.93,0:20:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,铁刃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.48,0:20:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 庄之介
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.45,0:20:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,180度回转
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.37,0:20:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,急速浮空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那个混账
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,臭鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.01,0:20:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}赢了 铁刃获得胜利了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:20:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,陪你一起修行也算值得了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.03,0:21:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是还想巴结鬼丸大人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,真会见风转舵呱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.08,0:21:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,胡说什么！那是作战计划
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.79,0:21:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,下次见面时
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.47,0:21:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就是决胜负的时候了 鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.54,0:23:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,给我听好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.12,0:23:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,尽快完成这座浮游城
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.38,0:23:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,准备来夺取天下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.71,0:23:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.63,0:23:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,忙到没时间休息了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.31,0:23:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在踢馆吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.02,0:23:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还在寻找刃的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.28,0:23:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好烦躁哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.78,0:23:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,下集 大和抚子来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.32,0:23:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是美女耶
